-    "zh": "各取舍下的定理问的是：在八个前提的某种取舍之下，计数服从哪些规律。按 Ren 的转向，本结果改问：每条规律在世界的哪些步与关系项上需要什么。证明表明所需的条件都是局部的：一步的规律只用该步、该条件上的平衡；停息只用跨过那些步、包含所立者的家族的下降，不需要封闭；下降约束变化对所立者不需要体现；不再存在需要生起只用覆盖成立者的列表，不需要普查。前提对每一步成立时，这些条件在每一步成立，各取舍下的结果因此是推论。读法（AI，依 Ren 的交托采用）：不用条件的理论中前提约束的规律，是每一步及其关系项的规律；前提是使它们的条件处处成立的一种方式。",
-    "en": "The theorems on choices of premises ask which laws the counts obey under a choice of the eight premises. Following Ren's redirect, this result asks instead what each law needs, at which steps and relata of the world. The proofs show the conditions are local: the laws of one step use balance only at that step and condition; rest uses only a family holding what stands running down across those steps, with no closure; running down bounds the change of what stands with no embodiment; ceasing needs arising uses only a list covering what holds, with no census. Where the premises hold at every step, these conditions hold at every step, so the results for each choice are corollaries. Reading (AI, adopted on Ren's delegation): the laws that the premises bound in the theory without the condition are laws of each step and its relata, and the premises are one way of making their conditions hold everywhere."
+    "zh": "各取舍下的定理问的是：在八个前提的某种取舍之下，计数满足哪些规律。按 Ren 的转向，本结果改问：每条规律在世界的哪些步与关系项上需要什么。证明表明所需的条件都是局部的：一步的规律只用该步、该条件上的平衡；停息只用跨过那些步、包含所立者的家族的下降，不需要封闭；下降约束变化对所立者不需要体现；不再存在需要生起只用覆盖成立者的列表，不需要普查。前提对每一步成立时，这些条件在每一步成立，各取舍下的结果因此是推论。读法（AI，依 Ren 的交托采用）：不用条件的理论中前提约束的规律，是每一步及其关系项的规律；前提是使它们的条件处处成立的一种方式。",
+    "en": "The theorems on choices of premises ask which laws the counts satisfy under a choice of the eight premises. Following Ren's redirect, this result asks instead what each law needs, at which steps and relata of the world. The proofs show the conditions are local: the laws of one step use balance only at that step and condition; rest uses only a family holding what stands running down across those steps, with no closure; running down bounds the change of what stands with no embodiment; ceasing needs arising uses only a list covering what holds, with no census. Where the premises hold at every step, these conditions hold at every step, so the results for each choice are corollaries. Reading (AI, adopted on Ren's delegation): the laws that the premises bound in the theory without the condition are laws of each step and its relata, and the premises are one way of making their conditions hold everywhere."
